@startuml uc-convert-member
!include _theme.iuml

state convertMember as "convertMember()" {

  state " " as NamingOnePerson
  state " " as Guarding
  state " " as Asking
  state " " as Converting

  [*] --> NamingOnePerson
  note on link
  <b>Operator</b> names one member to turn into an outside
  collaborator
  end note

  NamingOnePerson --> Guarding
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> applies the same two refusals a removal
  does — the last owner, and the account this run is
  authenticated as — because leaving the organisation
  is what this does, even though access remains
  end note

  Guarding --> Asking
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> refuses somebody who is not a member,
  and reports somebody who is already an outside
  collaborator without changing anything
  end note

  Asking --> Converting
  note on link
  <b>Operator</b> is told they stop being a member and keep
  only the repositories their current teams allow —
  and confirms
  end note

  Converting --> [*]
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> converts them and reports the outcome
  end note
}

convertMember --> CONFIGURATION_RESOLVED
note on link
a guard or a non-member exits 4;
declining exits 1; a refused request exits 5
end note
@enduml
